<p class="kind">Trust Freeze report</p>
<h1>Trust Freeze report: diff</h1>
<p class="lead">This page is a projection of the bundle named above: it shows what the bundle records, in the order the report document has it. It computes no new statement, it evaluates no signature, no key trust and no expiry, and it reads no clock. Where it shows such a state, it shows it as a quotation from the bundle, with the command that does evaluate it beside it.</p>
