<h2>Not on this page</h2>
<p class="note">What this page leaves out is named here, with the command that shows it. Nothing is left out
silently.</p>
<h3>The attribute digests of both sides of each of the 2 entries (before_digest, after_digest).</h3>
<p>An attribute value never appears in a diff; the digests stand for the normalized attribute maps. They are machine material, and they are in the report document.</p>
<pre>skillctl trust-freeze report --input &lt;bundle&gt; --output &lt;file.json&gt;</pre>

